    data_mapping: list[TargetMapping]

    dataflow_edges: list[DataflowEdge]
    view_name_map: dict[str, str]

    unknown_components: list[UnknownComponent] = []
    extensions: dict[str, Any] = Field(default_factory=dict)
```

**Zero-loss invariant**: union of every typed field + every `extensions` dict + `unknown_components[*].raw_dict` MUST cover every key/value in the lossless parse. Enforce with debug-mode assertion.

