## 17. FastAPI Service

```
POST /convert
  Body: multipart/form-data with field `file` (XML)
  Query (optional): ?verbose=true to include audit JSON
  Response (default): 200 OK, application/x-yaml, YAML body
                      Header X-Conversion-Warnings: <count>
  Response (verbose): 200 OK, application/json:
                      {"yaml": "...", "audit": {...}}
  Errors:
    - 400 if not valid XML or root != POWERMART
    - 422 if STRICT_MODE=true and judge fails after MAX_CORRECTION_ROUNDS
    - 500 on unexpected errors

GET /healthz
  200 OK, {"status": "ok"}
```

Audit (verbose mode) includes: phase timings, deterministic-vs-LLM component breakdown, per-Expression field-routing summary, view_name_map, validation rules with origin/source, LLM call counts per tool, list of UnknownComponents with confidence, judge rounds + final verdict, extensions key inventory.

